OL,3,GNEWSACharity to add second accessible
OL,4,Aboat to its fleet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity providing accessible boat
OL,7,Ftrips will be adding a second boat to
OL,8,Fits fleet, thanks to an anonymous
OL,9,Fdonation.
OL,11,FSince 2021, The Norfolk Charitable
OL,12,FTrust has provided boat trips around
OL,13,FBlakeney Harbour in a "wheelyboat"
OL,14,Fnamed Poppy, fitted with a ramp and
OL,15,Fenough space to accommodate up to two
OL,16,Fwheelchairs.
OL,18,FIn its first year, the charity ran 23
OL,19,Ffree-of-charge trips, and this year
OL,20,Fexpects to run more than 80.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
