OL,3,GNEWSACharity to add second accessible
OL,4,Aboat to its fleet
OL,5,
OL,6,FKaren Burton, fundraiser at the trust,
OL,7,Fsaid: "Poppy doesn't just provide a
OL,8,Fboat trip, it provides access to
OL,9,Fexperiences, memories, nature, family
OL,10,Ftime and a sense of freedom many people
OL,11,Fhave denied because of their
OL,12,Fdisability."
